msgid ""
"This is where you can setup your account. Please note that OpenId users must "
"first setup a password in the settings on the webpage. We can not use OpenId "
"unfortunatly."
msgstr ""
"Hier kannst Du Dien Togang instellen. Beacht, dat Brukers vun \"OpenId\" in "
"de Instellen op de Nettsiet toeerst en Passwoort fastleggen mööt. Leider "
"köönt wi \"OpenId\" nich bruken."

